  m_Name: Phase1_R2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::STEM.Experiments.Resistance.ResistancePhase
  instruction: 'Step 1: Assemble the circuit with resistor R2.

    The ammeter (RS102)
    is connected in series.

    Connect the voltmeter (RS101) in parallel across
    R2.

    Close the switch and press OK on the DL120.'
  resultText: 'Measurement: V = {V} V, I = {I} A


    Ohm''s Law:

    R2 = V /
    I = {Vn} / {In} = {R} Ohm


    The resistance of the cables is negligible.'
  requiredTopology: 1
  requiredVoltmeter: 2
